I'm still lost... 'T' is not one of the canned predictors in openCR, so I guess you provided it as a session covariate equivalent to the Session canned predictor. For custom covariates you will need to provide a custom newdata.

fit <- openCR.fit(dipperCH, type='PLBl', model = list(phi~1, lambda~T), sessioncov=data.frame(T=0:6), details=list(stepmax=100)) # arbitrary stepmax to overcome fitting problem
newdat <- data.frame(session= factor(1:7))
newdat$T <- 0:6
predict(fit, newdata = newdat)
